 "emails": [
  {
   "subject": "Parshwanath Capital Ventures Fund | Pre-IPO & Anchor interest – Tenty Limited",
   "text": "Dear Pradip Agarwal and Rishika Rander,\n\nI am CA Deep Dalal, Fund Manager of Parshwanath Capital Ventures Fund. I am writing to you as the Book Running Lead Manager to the proposed IPO of Tenty Limited, whose Draft Red Herring Prospectus dated September 29, 2026 has been filed with SEBI for listing on the Main Board of BSE and NSE.\n\nABOUT US\nParshwanath Capital Ventures Fund is a SEBI-registered Category III Alternative Investment Fund focused on India's primary markets. We invest through Pre-IPO placements, IPO Anchor Investor books, the QIB portion of IPOs and Qualified Institutional Placements (QIPs), working closely with promoters and merchant bankers through the listing journey.\n\nOUR VIEW ON TENTY\nTenty is one of the leading manufacturers of RPP products and writing instruments in Eastern India, offering customised packaging solutions to operators in the FMCG and writing instruments industries. We have studied the DRHP closely, and the business and its growth trajectory fit well with our investment focus.\n\nKey financials (restated, ₹ crore unless stated)\n                                       FY26       FY25       FY24\nRevenue from operations (₹ cr)       822.25     415.47     362.24\nGrowth (YoY)                          97.9%      14.7%          –\nEBITDA (₹ cr)                         79.44      31.59      31.61\nEBITDA margin                          9.7%       7.6%       8.7%\nProfit after tax (₹ cr)               22.65       6.80       8.75\nPAT margin                             2.8%       1.6%       2.4%\nNet worth (₹ cr)                     347.55     319.12      96.22\nReturn on net worth                    6.5%       2.1%       9.1%\nDebt / Equity                         0.75x      0.55x      0.31x\nSource: restated financial information in the DRHP; EBITDA and ratios computed from it.\n\nHOW WE WOULD LIKE TO PARTICIPATE\n  1. Pre-IPO placement: The DRHP contemplates a Pre-IPO Placement of up to 20% of the Fresh Issue. We would be keen to participate in this round.\n  2. Anchor Investor portion: As a SEBI-registered Category III AIF, we qualify as a QIB and would like to be considered for the anchor book.\n  3. QIB portion: We would also look to participate in the QIB portion of the IPO.\n\nFUND PROFILE\nView our fund profile (PDF): https://drive.google.com/file/d/1yQX3TH3nmyqzt6rICyliVYFCP1okKqVv/view?usp=sharing (also attached)\n\nI would be grateful if you could introduce us to the promoters of Tenty (Ashok Goyal, Nishi Goyal and Kanishk Goyal) and keep us informed as the pre-IPO and anchor book discussions progress. A short call at your convenience would be much appreciated.\n\nI look forward to hearing from you.\n\nWarm regards,\n\nCA Deep Dalal\nFund Manager, Parshwanath Capital Ventures Fund\nSEBI-registered Category III AIF\nEmail: fundmanager@parshwanath.in\nWhatsApp: +91 83200 52970\nPhone / WhatsApp: +91 70690 06298\nSEBI Reg. No.: IN/AIF3/25-26/2108\n\nThis email is for introduction purposes only and does not constitute an offer, solicitation or commitment to invest. Any investment is subject to the Fund's due diligence, investment committee approval and applicable SEBI regulations. To stop receiving emails from us, reply with “unsubscribe”.",
   "html": "<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\"><meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light dark\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 12px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"640\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:640px;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0 4px 16px 4px;border-bottom:3px double #A07A35;text-align:center\"><img src=\"cid:pcvf-logo\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Parshwanath Capital Ventures Fund logo\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto 10px auto;border:0;width:96px;height:96px;border-radius:48px\"><div style=\"font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.2px;color:#A07A35;line-height:1.25\">Parshwanath Capital Ventures Fund</div><div style=\"font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:2.2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7B8491;margin-top:6px\">SEBI-registered Category III AIF &middot; Pre-IPO &middot; Anchor &middot; QIB &middot; QIP</div><div style=\"font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#7B8491;margin-top:4px\">SEBI Regn. No. IN/AIF3/25-26/2108</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 4px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.4px;color:#7B8491;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5\">Re: <b style=\"color:#A07A35\">Tenty Limited</b> &nbsp;|&nbsp; Mainboard IPO &nbsp;|&nbsp; DRHP dated September 29, 2026</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 4px 22px 4px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.65;\">Dear Pradip Agarwal and Rishika Rander,</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.65;\">I am CA Deep Dalal, Fund Manager of Parshwanath Capital Ventures Fund. I am writing to you as the Book Running Lead Manager to the proposed IPO of Tenty Limited, whose Draft Red Herring Prospectus dated September 29, 2026 has been filed with SEBI for listing on the Main Board of BSE and NSE.</p><p style=\"margin:24px 0 8px 0;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A07A35;\">About us</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 6px 0\"><tr><td style=\"border-left:3px solid #A07A35;padding:4px 0 4px 16px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.65\">Parshwanath Capital Ventures Fund is a SEBI-registered Category III Alternative Investment Fund focused on India&#x27;s primary markets. We invest through Pre-IPO placements, IPO Anchor Investor books, the QIB portion of IPOs and Qualified Institutional Placements (QIPs), working closely with promoters and merchant bankers through the listing journey.</td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:24px 0 8px 0;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A07A35;\">Our view on Tenty</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.65;\">Tenty is one of the leading manufacturers of RPP products and writing instruments in Eastern India, offering customised packaging solutions to operators in the FMCG and writing instruments industries. We have studied the DRHP closely, and the business and its growth trajectory fit well with our investment focus.</p><p style=\"margin:24px 0 8px 0;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A07A35;\">Key financials <span style=\"color:#7B8491;letter-spacing:.4px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400\">(₹ crore unless stated)</span></p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 6px 0\"><tr><th style=\"padding:9px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.8px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A07A35;text-align:right;border-top:2px solid #A07A35;border-bottom:2px solid #A07A35;text-align:left\">Particulars</th><th style=\"padding:9px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.8px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A07A35;text-align:right;border-top:2px solid #A07A35;border-bottom:2px solid #A07A35;\">FY26</th><th style=\"padding:9px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.8px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A07A35;text-align:right;border-top:2px solid #A07A35;border-bottom:2px solid #A07A35;\">FY25</th><th style=\"padding:9px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.8px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A07A35;text-align:right;border-top:2px solid #A07A35;border-bottom:2px solid #A07A35;\">FY24</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:left\">Revenue from operations (₹ cr)</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">822.25</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">415.47</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">362.24</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:left\">Growth (YoY)</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">97.9%</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">14.7%</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">–</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:left\">EBITDA (₹ cr)</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">79.44</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">31.59</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">31.61</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:left\">EBITDA margin</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">9.7%</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">7.6%</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">8.7%</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:left\">Profit after tax (₹ cr)</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">22.65</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">6.80</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">8.75</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:left\">PAT margin</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">2.8%</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">1.6%</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">2.4%</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:left\">Net worth (₹ cr)</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">347.55</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">319.12</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">96.22</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:left\">Return on net worth</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">6.5%</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">2.1%</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">9.1%</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe